        dsm5:Intellectual_Developmental_Disorder_Intellectual_Disability__Severity_3 ;
    med:hasSpecifierText """The various levels of severity are defined on the basis of adaptive
functioning, and not IQ scores, because it is adaptive functioning that
determines the level of supports required. Moreover, IQ measures are
less valid in the lower end of the IQ range."""@en ;
