    med:hasSymptom dsm5:Agoraphobia_Criterion_B__HP_0032942 ;
    rdfs:comment "The individual fears or avoids these situations because of thoughts that escape might be difficult or help might not be available in the event of developing panic-like symptoms or other incapacitating or embarrassing symptoms (e.g., fear of falling in the elderly; fear of incontinence)"@en .

