    med:hasSymptom dsm5:Language_Disorder_Criterion_A__HP_0002463 ;
    rdfs:comment "Persistent difficulties in the acquisition and use of language across modalities (i.e., spoken, written, sign language, or other) due to deficits in comprehension or production that include the following Reduced vocabulary (word knowledge and use). Limited sentence structure (ability to put words and word endings together to form sentences based on the rules of grammar and morphology). Impairments in discourse (ability to use vocabulary and connect sentences to explain or describe a topic or series of events or have a conversation)."@en .

dsm5:Language_Disorder_Criterion_A__HP_0002463 a dsm5:Symptom,
