    rdfs:comment "Clinically significant problematic behavioral changes (e.g., belligerence, assaultiveness, impulsiveness, unpredictability, psychomotor agitation, impaired judgment) that developed during, or shortly after, phencyclidine use"@en .

dsm5:Phencyclidine_Intoxication_Criterion_B__HP_0033511 a dsm5:Symptom,
