    rdfs:comment "Either of the following REM sleep without atonia on polysomnographic recording. A history suggestive of REM sleep behavior disorder and an established synucleinopathy diagnosis (e.g., Parkinson's disease, multiple system atrophy)."@en .

dsm5:Rapid_Eye_Movement_Sleep_Behavior_Disorder_Criterion_D__HP_5200291 a dsm5:Symptom,
