    med:hasSymptom dsm5:Specific_Learning_Disorder_Criterion_C__HP_0010522 ;
    rdfs:comment "The learning difficulties begin during school-age years but may not become fully manifest until the demands for those affected academic skills exceed the individual's limited capacities (e.g., as in timed tests, reading or writing lengthy complex reports for a tight deadline, excessively heavy academic loads)"@en .

dsm5:Specific_Learning_Disorder_Criterion_C__HP_0010522 a dsm5:Symptom,
